sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as user1 (Postman / Swagger)
    participant KC as Keycloak :8180
    participant GW as API Gateway :8080
    participant RS as Reservation Service
    participant RDB as reservations_db
    participant FS as Flight Service
    participant FDB as flights_db

    U->>KC: login OIDC (password grant / auth code + PKCE)
    KC-->>U: JWT (rol USER, sub)
    U->>GW: POST /api/v1/reservations {passengerId, flightId} + Bearer JWT
    Note over GW: SecurityConfig: valida firma (JWKS) y rol por ruta
    GW->>RS: reenvía + X-Correlation-Id
    Note over RS: valida el JWT otra vez · pasajero propio (sub)
    RS->>RDB: INSERT reserva PENDING (tx corta)
    RS->>KC: client_credentials (token SERVICE, cacheado)
    RS->>FS: POST /internal/v1/flights/{id}/seat-allocations {reservationId}
    FS->>FDB: UPDATE flights SET seats_taken+1 WHERE seats_taken < capacity
    FDB-->>FS: 1 fila
    FS-->>RS: 201 plaza asignada
    RS->>RDB: UPDATE reserva → CONFIRMED
    RS-->>GW: 201 CONFIRMED
    GW-->>U: 201 CONFIRMED + X-Correlation-Id

    alt Curso alternativo: sin plaza / vuelo no reservable
        FDB-->>FS: 0 filas
        FS-->>RS: 409 NO_AVAILABILITY | FLIGHT_NOT_RESERVABLE
        RS->>RDB: reserva → REJECTED
        RS-->>U: 409
    else Curso alternativo: Flight caído o lento
        RS--xFS: sin respuesta (connect 2 s / read 3 s)
        RS->>FS: DELETE seat-allocations/{reservationId} (idempotente)
        RS->>RDB: reserva → REJECTED (o queda PENDING → job cada 1 min)
        RS-->>U: 503 / 504
    end
